OL,3,GNEWSAFamily calls for more brain tumour
OL,4,Aresearch funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a Butlins activity
OL,7,Finstructor who has a brain tumour say
OL,8,Fmore funds are needed for research into
OL,9,Fthe condition.
OL,11,FBob Carroll-Hallett, from Shoreham, was
OL,12,F28 when he had a seizure and it was
OL,13,Fdiscovered he had an astrocytoma.
OL,15,FGiven an estimated eight to 10 years to
OL,16,Flive, he is due to have a second
OL,17,Foperation in Brighton on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
